ormation Search\nCounty Logo\nHow Do I\nApply For/Obtain\n911 Address\nEmployment Opportunities\nEconomic Development\nData Center\nGIS Data\nHoliday Schedule\nBuilding Permits\nPlanning Permits\nContact Us\nDownload/Read\nMinutes And Agendas\nEmployee Forms And Manuals\nMeeting Information\nPublic Notices\nRetirement Information\nFind/Learn About\nImportant Weather Information\nSpecial Needs Registration\nSpecial Needs Registration\nHertford County Emergencies\nTerrorist Threat Advisory From Homeland Security\nVolunteer Opportunities\nLocal Links\nNorth Carolina Links\nReport A Concern\nFacebook\nYoutube\nTwitter\nBoard of Elections\nMission\nRegistration and Voting\nEarly Voting\nForms\nElections\nCandidates\nGet Involved\nMaps\nHome\nDepartments\nCounty Administration\nBoard of Elections\nBoard of Elections\nUPDATE\nVOTER PHOTO ID\nCurrent Status: Photo ID Required for Voting\nOn, Friday, April 28, 2023, the North Carolina Supreme Court, reversed the injunction against implementation of the Photo ID legislation. As a result, the Photo ID statutes enacted in 2018 and 2019 will be implemented going forward, starting with the 2023 Municipal Election. This page will be updated when additional guidance is provided by the NC State Board of Elections. Please Visit\nVoter ID | NCSBE\nfor more information.\nHow to Know Your Vote Counted in North Carolina\nMeeting Information\nClick here for meeting information\nLocation and Hours\nPhysical Address\n418 Everett Street, Suite A\nAhoskie, NC 27910\nMailing Address\nP.O. Box 355\nAhoskie, NC 27910\nOffice:\n(252) 358-7812\nFacsimile:\n(252) 513-8454\nOffice Hours:\nM-F 8:30-5:00\nNational Voter Registration Data & Statistics\nFacebook link\nSIGN UP TO RESIDENTS GROUP ON HERTFORD COUNTY, NC ALERTS\nOfficial website of Hertford County Government. All Rights Reserved. | Thank you for visiting the Hertford County Website.\n\u00a9 2026 Hertford County, NC\nWinton, North Carolina 27986\nHOURS: 8:30 a.m. to 5:00 p.m. M-F\nPowered by